# `test/rec88-baseline-probe.mjs` runs against so the over-strictness digest is a
# CROSS-CHECKOUT measurement rather than this tree agreeing with itself. Both live
# INSIDE this worktree because the shared scratchpad is not isolated between
# sessions (WORKER.md) and stashing is repository-wide. An untracked copy of a
# plane source left behind by an interrupted arm is exactly what another item's
# producer sweep has already enrolled as a second author.
.pristine-rec88/


# REC-105's control pen and its pristine origin/main baseline checkout, each named
