# M0-99 (2026-09-22): the ruling index is GENERATED ON DEMAND and never committed (`ORCHESTRATION.md` §"THE RECORD IS
# PARTITIONED BY WRITER", rule 2). `node tools/decided.mjs` writes it for this working tree; a reader goes through the
# tool's one freshness call, `fresh()`. This line does NOT apply to a tracked file, so a merge that keeps a pre-M0-99
# branch's copy re-tracks it silently: `plancheck` arm 2b fails on a tracked copy, naming the fix (`git rm --cached`).
docs/DECIDED.md

